  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEBUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ PARMF AT END GO TO PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'RL'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PRL-IN TO P-INLEN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PRL-OUT TO P-OUTLEN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PRL-NC TO P-NC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'CD'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-IT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'C' TO IT-TYPE (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PCD-POS TO IT-A (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PCD-LEN TO IT-B (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PCD-VAL TO IT-VAL (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'MV'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-IT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'M' TO IT-TYPE (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PMV-IP TO IT-A (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PMV-IL TO IT-B (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PMV-OP TO IT-C (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 0 TO IT-CODE (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        PERFORM CODE-MAP THRU CODE-MAP-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'KT'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-IT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'K' TO IT-TYPE (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PKT-OP TO IT-A (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PKT-LEN TO IT-B (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PKT-VAL TO IT-VAL (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'TL'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-IT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PTL-K TO IT-A (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'T' TO IT-TYPE (N-IT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        IF PTL-KIND = 'O'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           MOVE 'U' TO IT-TYPE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CODE-MAP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PMV-CODE = 'D24 '
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO IT-CODE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PMV-CODE = 'D42 '
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 2 TO IT-CODE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PMV-CODE = 'D22A'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 3 TO IT-CODE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PMV-CODE = 'D22B'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 4 TO IT-CODE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PMV-CODE = 'D66A'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 5 TO IT-CODE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PMV-CODE = 'D66B'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 6 TO IT-CODE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PMV-CODE = 'D68 '
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 7 TO IT-CODE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PMV-CODE = 'D86 '
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 8 TO IT-CODE (N-IT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CODE-MAP-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT FI1.
