  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO CNT-INIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => TRT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO RECIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FI1 INTO RECIN AT END GO TO FIN-TRT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-IN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN-LEN TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > P-INLEN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-INLEN TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE RECIN (1:CP-LEN) TO WS-IN (1:CP-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'N' TO WS-RECORD-TRANSFORME-22A-200X.
